<<<
the same equality with men in the exercise of the franchise (As no other equality has been in question, same & equality are tautological; in the same position as, or on an equality with).
===
the same equality *with men in the exercise of the franchise* (As no other equality has been in question, *same equality* are tautological; *in the same position as, or on an equality with*).
