<<<
due, any obligatory payment, the nature being usually specified by an attributive noun, as harbour, market, dues.
===
*due,* any obligatory payment, the nature being usually specified by an attributive noun, as *harbour, market, dues*.
>>>

<<<
duty, tax levied on specific articles or transactions, not on persons; see also the note on tag above.
===
*duty,* tax levied on specific articles or transactions, not on persons; see also the note on *tax* above.
>>>

